## 🔧 The Definitive 7-Component Stack

### Complete Pipeline Flow

```
📞 Phone/Web Audio (8kHz/16kHz)
  │
  ├─ 🎛️ AI_ENGINE_MODE check (server/.env)
  │
  ▼ LOCAL MODE
  ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────┐
  │ ① Silero VAD (~10ms, CPU)                   │
  │     ↓ speech detected                       │
  │ ② faster-whisper + IndicWhisper (~150ms)    │
  │     ↓ Tamil/English/Tanglish transcript     │
  │ ③ Intent Extractor (deterministic rules)    │
  │     ↓ structured intent JSON                │
  │ ④ Order State Machine (code decides)        │
  │     ↓ next action + response template       │
  │ ⑤ Qwen 2.5 3B + Tamil LoRA (~180ms)        │
  │     ↓ natural language response             │
  │ ⑥ Piper TTS → IndicF5 (~80-120ms)          │
  │     ↓ Tamil/English audio                   │
  │ ⑦ Data Logger (training pipeline)           │
  └─────────────────────────────────────────────┘
  │
  ▼
  🎧 PCM / μ-law Audio Response (<400ms E2E)
```

