## Component ④: Order State Machine

> **Selected: Dedicated State Machine Service** (from Document A)

```
new → collecting_items → collecting_address → pricing
  → awaiting_confirmation → confirmed → dispatched
  → completed | cancelled | failed
```

| Property | Detail |
|----------|--------|
| **Implementation** | `server/src/services/orderStateMachine.js` |
| **License** | Your own code ✅ |
| **Latency** | <2ms |
| **Why separate from LLM** | The LLM cannot skip steps. If address is missing, the state machine forces address collection. If items are empty, it forces item collection. |

