| Sarvam-1 2B | ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ (best Tamil) | 2B | ⚠️ Non-commercial | ✅ Yes | ✅ But license restricts |
| Gemma 2 2B | ⭐⭐⭐ | 2B | ⚠️ Restricted | ✅ Yes | ✅ But license restricts |
