## Component ⑦: Data Pipeline & Training Infrastructure

> **Selected: Full logging pipeline** (from Document A — not in Document B)

### Every call stores:

```json
{
  "call_id": "vc_20260812_001",
  "merchant_id": "m_coimbatore_01",
  "audio_file": "/recordings/vc_20260812_001.wav",
  "transcript": "oru chicken biryani, rendu naan kudunga",
  "language_detected": "ta-IN",
  "intent_json": {"intent": "add_item", "items": [{"name": "Chicken Biryani", "qty": 1}, {"name": "Naan", "qty": 2}]},
  "final_order_json": {"items": [...], "total": 310, "address": "..."},
  "confidence_score": 0.92,
  "correction_events": [],
  "call_outcome": "order_confirmed",
  "latency_metrics": {"vad_ms": 12, "stt_ms": 145, "llm_ms": 178, "tts_ms": 72, "total_ms": 407},
  "human_feedback": null
}
```

### Why this matters for your training goals:

| Training Method | What it needs from data pipeline | Supported? |
|----------------|----------------------------------|:----------:|
| **PEFT/LoRA** | (transcript, intent_json) pairs | ✅ |
| **RLHF** | correction_events + human_feedback from dashboard button | ✅ |
| **RLAIF** | confidence_score enables AI-as-judge reward model | ✅ |
| **DPO** | Paired (chosen response, rejected response) from corrections | ✅ |
| **RL2F** | Live call_outcome feedback loop | ✅ |
| **RHLM** | Full conversation history + corrections | ✅ |

