## 📋 Implementation Sprint Plan

### Sprint 1 — Core Local Engine (Week 1-2)
- [ ] Set up `AI_ENGINE_MODE=local` toggle in `.env`
- [ ] Deploy Silero VAD in audio pipeline
- [ ] Deploy faster-whisper + IndicWhisper (small) for Tamil STT
- [ ] Deploy Ollama + Qwen 2.5 3B for LLM
- [ ] Deploy Piper TTS + IndicVoices Tamil
- [ ] Wire triple-fallback: local → cloud → rule engine
- [ ] Add RLHF feedback button on dashboard

### Sprint 2 — Intelligence Layer (Week 3-4)
- [ ] Build intent extractor (deterministic rules)
- [ ] Build order state machine (dedicated service)
- [ ] Separate LLM from business logic
- [ ] Build data logging pipeline (audio + transcript + intent + corrections)
- [ ] Build golden evaluation set (first 100 calls)

### Sprint 3 — Voice Quality Upgrade (Week 5-6)
- [ ] Deploy IndicF5 TTS alongside Piper
- [ ] A/B test voice quality (merchant feedback)
- [ ] Record restaurant-specific reference voices (8-15s clips)
- [ ] Enable zero-shot voice cloning per merchant

### Sprint 4 — Self-Training Loop (Week 7-8)
- [ ] First LoRA fine-tune of IndicWhisper on real call data
- [ ] First LoRA fine-tune of Qwen 2.5 on JSON extraction
- [ ] Build RLHF training loop from correction_events
- [ ] Build automated WER evaluation pipeline
- [ ] Per-merchant LoRA adapter experiments

